I have released direct serial port support for Linux and other operating
systems in javAPRSSrvr.  javAPRSSrvr is a Java APRS server with
comprehensive IGate and APRS digipeater capabilities.  This serial port
support is pure Java (no native code) and is usable on any machine with
a JVM 1.1.4 or later.  The serial port support is for TNC's in KISS mode
only.

If you have an interest in converting from aprsd to javAPRSSrvr or if
you have an interest in implementing a new APRS server, IGate, and/or
digipeater with javAPRSSrvr, please contact me off-sig at
pete@ae5pl.net.

